# tail23 bomb chain v6: lay a bomb under the ball, and in a following tick place the Cyclops onto
# it and evaluate InMaxRange in the same tick (its fuse is disabled when it is found), so the
# machine can later take the bomb (mBombId set, msgs to SelectTarget/GetUp/ShootBomb).
@f600 tp 148 213.3 -13.0
@f620 give morphBallBombs 1
@f640 press x 20
@f660 objs CBomb
@f700 press a 2
@f706 place u047b player 1 ; trigcall u047b InMaxRange
@f712 trigcall u047b InMaxRange
@f720 objs CBomb ; trigcall u047b InMaxRange
@f740 obj u047b
@f800 obj u047b
@f860 trigcall u047b InMaxRange ; obj u047b
@f920 obj u047b
@f980 obj u047b
@f1040 trigcall u047b InMaxRange ; obj u047b
@f1100 obj u047b
@f1200 obj u047b
@f1300 obj u047b
@f1400 obj u047b
